This page practices **classes and objects**. The code demonstrates how a class defines fields and how an object stores values in those fields.

```java
class Person {
    String name;
    Person(String name) { this.name = name; }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Person p = new Person("Asha");
        System.out.println(p.name);
    }
}
```

